# ============================================================
# SOP-Bench
# 上传策略：只发布「代码 + 配置 + 提示词 + 文档 + 自建数据集本体」，
#          排除 Python 环境、第三方数据集、媒体副本、运行缓存。
# ============================================================

# ---------- Python 环境与缓存 ----------
.venv*/
venv/
env/
runtime/
.cache/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ---------- 第三方数据集与文献 ----------
# 体积大且各有独立许可，请按 docs/DATA.md 中的脚本自行下载
annotations/
datasets/
papers/
sources/
archive/failed_downloads/

# ---------- 媒体与二进制产物 ----------
*.mp4
*.mov
*.avi
*.mkv
*.webm
*.flv
*.jpg
*.JPG
*.jpeg
*.png
*.gif
*.webp
*.bmp
*.ppm
*.whl
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.zip
*.7z
*.sqlite3
*.db
*.npy
*.npz
*.pt
*.pth
*.bin
*.ckpt
*.safetensors

# ---------- 运行痕迹 ----------
*.log
*.pid
*.lock
nohup.out
api_cache/
api_cache_failures/
service_logs/
*.stdout
*.stderr

# ---------- outputs：保留数据集本体，剔除逐条目中间台账 ----------
# 媒体副本
outputs/**/media/
outputs/**/review_media/
outputs/**/render/
outputs/**/*.mp4
# 逐条目生成/审核台账
outputs/impact_qa/*/inputs/
outputs/impact_qa/*/plans/
outputs/impact_qa/*/trials/
outputs/impact_qa/*/media_manifests/
outputs/impact_qa/*/results/
outputs/impact_qa/*/runs/
outputs/impact_qa/*/smoke/
outputs/impact_qa/*/batch*/
outputs/impact_qa/*/browser/
outputs/impact_qa/*/inspection/
outputs/impact_qa/*/revisions/
outputs/impact_qa/*/guidance_browser/
outputs/impact_qa/*/timeline_browser/
outputs/impact_qa/*/human_reviews/
outputs/impact_qa/*/review_archives/
# 一次性压测/探针目录
outputs/impact_qa/framebudget_test/
outputs/impact_qa/framebudget_probe*.json

# ---------- 放行：应用与审计报告所需的少量静态资源 ----------
# （上面的全局 *.jpg/*.png 规则会误伤，这里按目录回补）
!apps/impact_assembly_3d/assets/*.jpg
!apps/impact_assembly_3d/assets/*.png
!reports/**/*.png
!cc4d_annotations/**/*.png
!cc4d_annotations/**/*.jpg
